msgid "ISMS roles"
msgstr "ISMS roles"

msgid "For each role, choose the GLPI group of the people who hold it (holders and substitutes) and a generic e-mail address that does not change when the person changes. The group receives the notifications and reads the documents of the internal audits (CISO); the generic address is shown on the registers and can be chosen as a notification recipient. The roles are shown on the responsibility matrix (ISMS organisation)."
msgstr "For each role, choose the GLPI group of the people who hold it (holders and substitutes) and a generic e-mail address that does not change when the person changes. The group receives the notifications and reads the documents of the internal audits (CISO); the generic address is shown on the registers and can be chosen as a notification recipient. The roles are shown on the responsibility matrix (ISMS organisation)."

